[0.001, "o", "\u001b[1;32mmarshal\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "Right. Off you go. You may cross the Bridge of Death.                           \r\n\r\nYou have successfully passed the Bridge of Death! One trial remains before you  \r\nmay seek the Grail: you must now face the \u001b[1mKnights Who Say Ni\u001b[0m.                   \r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.203, "o", "\u001b[1;36mseeker\u001b[0m: Now I approach the Knights Who Say Ni. What shrubberies are on offer?\r\n"]
